{"id":692,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"By detonating gas that accumulates in its right claw, this Pokémon launches water like a bullet. This is how Clauncher defeats its enemies."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Clauncher’s claws can fall off during battle, but they’ll regenerate. The meat inside the claws is popular as a delicacy in Galar."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It moves around by jetting water from its right pincer. It has a poor sense of balance, so it’s terrible at swimming straight."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its claws occasionally fall off, and it keeps a low profile until they grow back. The meat of its claws is so delicious!"},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"Through controlled explosions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"They knock down flying prey by firing compressed water from their massive claws like shooting a pistol."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Mega Launcher","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up pulse moves."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Water 3"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":692,"name":"Clauncher","condition":null,"children":[{"id":693,"name":"Clawitzer","condition":"Lv. 37","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,55],[1,150],[10,175],[15,453],[20,479],[25,468],[30,352],[35,14],[40,396],[45,340],[50,330],[55,152]],"machine":[396,59,886,399,406,203,263,430,812,270,56,58,196,710,341,189,330,884,182,240,156,157,214,482,479,164,57,14,36,851,168,369,474,352,127,311],"egg":[401,61,494],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv1-205","name":"Clauncher","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"205","artist":"Shinya Komatsu","img":"sv1/205"},{"id":"me1-37","name":"Clauncher","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"37","artist":null,"img":"me1/3